{"id":"wb-7-1393","name":"南诏镇古建筑群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"南诏镇古建筑群","text":"南诏镇古建筑群位于云南省巍山县南诏镇，巍山古城东北隅。由东西向的三条轴线从北向南依次排列为玉皇阁、文华书院、萧公祠三个建筑群，形成了一个规模较大的古建筑群。2013年5月，以“南诏镇古建筑群”公布为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8D%97%E8%AF%8F%E9%95%87%E5%8F%A4%E5%BB%BA%E7%AD%91%E7%BE%A4","revisionId":94028222,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94028222","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/7f8f6adad2606cee9f67d4e2.jpg","title":"Wenhua_Academy_of_Weishan.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Wenhua_Academy_of_Weishan.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0d/Wenhua_Academy_of_Weishan.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Xin","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​巍山文华书院","width":320,"height":213}}